ry anti-shim requirement satisfied for source? They fail actual dependency. For artifact? yes.\nNeed maybe ensure no pre-degraded canonical row in artifact TC-6.3b. They now use processEventArchiveEntryFixture ready row. good.\n\nNeed maybe perhaps inspect lines with line numbers to cite resolved rationale. Also maybe maybe need not broad re-review. We'll gather line numbers with nl. Also maybe maybe run `git diff` no need. Need line numbers around relevant sections of archive-read.service and tests. Let's do `nl -ba` relevant ranges and maybe run gates."}}
