p path (`tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts:567-609`). That satisfies the story anti-shim requirement to fail the actual enrichment dependency rather than fabricating a degraded response.\"}],\"newFindings\":[],\"openFindings\":[],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-6.1\",\"TC-6.1a\",\"AC-6.2\",\"TC-6.2a\",\"AC-6.3\",\"TC-6.3a\",\"TC-6.3b\"],\"unverified\":[]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm vitest tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"pass\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"The added source-lookup-failure test is not named as a TC, but it closes the anti-shim proof point by failing the real enrichment dependency while preserving unrelated archive entries on the same page.\",\"`verify-all` passed after the fix, so the Story 6 convergence work did not regress the broader archive, turn, or derived-view surfaces.\"]}"}}
